ed":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-29T17:41:22-07:00","id":268638,"title":"","content":"Nope, not sure what it is but I heard that alot, seems people are adding the wrong guy. Let me share the avatar<br /> <a href=\"http://smg.photobucket.com/user/aerozord/media/PRS_ShruggingPony-01_zps4fdddc89.jpg.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v135/aerozord/PRS_ShruggingPony-01_zps4fdddc89.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T11:47:48-07:00","id":269318,"title":"","content":"Ok guys only three people have added me to skype and only two of those gave me character sheets. Remember I need atleast three if you want me to run this thing","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T13:15:32-07:00","id":269410,"title":"","content":"I just found this thread and I've been itching for some exalted fun. Is it too late to throw my name in the hat?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1499,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","user":"MrBojangles","date":". 09-30-2014, 04:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T13:42:01-07:00","id":269444,"title":"","content":"Its open until we either start or it fills up, neither of which has happened yet so you are free to join.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T16:25:31-07:00","id":269587,"title":"","content":"Alright, so I have an idea for a Zenith Caste Sky Captain from Haslanti. Basically Kung-Fu Jesus meets Captain America with an airship. I don't know how you feel about Backing and Allies but I wanted to grab a freshly exalted dragon-blooded outcaste to act as a Bucky to my Captain America and a dot in Backing because he's still technically in the military. The dragon-blooded will provide agency as to why a young aspiring doctor joined the military (he followed his best friend in). Is their any issue to this and am I stepping on any toes? I know I saw a Dusk Caste Martial Artist early.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T16:51:28-07:00","id":269599,"title":"","content":"Biggest issue, you aren't starting the game with an airship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T19:15:28-07:00","id":269722,"title":"","content":"Whoops! I guess I should've asked this first. What's the scale of this game? Would me having ties to a military or even a (rather large) country get in the way of the story? How established can we be? Most of my experience with the North can be summed up as &quot;Vikings with Airships&quot; so that's what I default to. I also saw where we could end up in a world located out in the Wyld which sounds awesome! But how much effort should we put into connecting ourselves to Creation? I'd hate to put work into something that simply is not going to matter. I have zero problem with making something that fits, I just like to know my limitations before hand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-30T21:51:31-07:00","id":269834,"title":"","content":"Considering the other members in the group a low profile will be preferred. Its less about you having established connections and more about you having a massive easy to spot attention grabbing airship. I have the same issue with someone wearing full oricalcum armor (unless they had a charm to hide it). Though the issue of firepower is also a concern. We are not trying to min/max. I think the highest attribute + ability pool any player has is a 9. Nor is the artifact rating of their weapon above two. These are not hard rules of course but to give you an idea of where the group is in power.<br /> <br /> Pretty much all of the group are on the run for one reason or another. Its ok if you personally have a reputation, and allies, and contacts, and wealthy. Just so long as you can avoid drawing attention to yourself when you want to. <br /> <br /> When it comes to traveling outside of Creation. Unless in game your characters actively make an effort to go there, it wont be happening any time soon. Short term goal is some light stuff for you guys to settle into a group dynamic and get a feel for everything. Maybe sprinkle in some plot seeds, But hey we normally dont play campaigns in the north so lets have fun. Fair warning I wont do much with canon cities cause I dont know the North that well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T08:28:42-07:00","id":270142,"title":"","content":"Considering how the party is shaping up so far, if you don't start the game with an airship, we will probably eventually steal/build one (probably not right away).<br /> <br /> My character has a ... complicated relationship with the Seventh Legion. Almost turning Lookshy into a crater would do that. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T09:05:04-07:00","id":270156,"title":"","content":"Artifacts: I told you not to touch it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T10:43:31-07:00","id":270194,"title":"","content":"Ha! I just thought of a neat idea for my character. I could take crafting and use my cover as a Scavenger Lord to &quot;find&quot; the things I craft and sell them for a profit. So I might end up spending future xp on crafting after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T10:53:02-07:00","id":270195,"title":"","content":"Soo... Who wants to go first in posting their character sheet? =D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T10:58:26-07:00","id":270199,"title":"","content":"But but... How can I be a secret Green Sun Prince, if I post my character sheet?!?!<br /> <br /> My fake Twilight Character Sheet: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-UiWxItb8fkZFRFczZ3MEMtazg/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-U...ew?usp=sharing</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 10-01-2014, 02:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T12:16:24-07:00","id":270267,"title":"","content":"Not sure if we will be playing this friday. I got three character sheets, but alot of maybes. If Spaaace can get in touch with me on skype I may still run it with who-ever got their characters approved by the end of today.<br /> <br /> I will also be answering a question here.since I feel you all should know how I'll be handling mundane equipment. There will be three basic catagories<br /> <br /> Consumables: I will tell you how much food and water you have. I just want this to give you guys pause to actually plan and prepare as well as a plot device. &quot;You only have a days worth of food left, luckily you can see a town on the horizon.&quot;<br /> <br /> Bare minimum: Things you basically just need to survive at all. I'll handwave you having a tent and sleeping bag for example. Though if its handwaved I'll also be assuming its crap. If your character cares enough that they need a sleeping bag woven from the finest silk than you should care enough to write it down. This also works for things I tied to your character. I am fine with assuming a tailor has a needle and thread, or a cook has a basic cooking pot. I'm also going to assume anyone with resource dots has some cash on them, proportional to the number of dots they have.<br /> <br /> Misc: Pretty much anything else. Things like rope or medical supplies (you are an exalt so this isn't a bare minimum) any comfort items, those you will have to list. I'm less a stickler for keeping detailed track of it and more that I want you guys to show you are trying to anticipate things and staying versatile. If you list a flint and steel and during the game it breaks I'm not going to punish you for forgetting to buy one when in town. Can just say &quot;I am getting supplies&quot; and thanks to initial set up we'll know what your character considers supplies.<br /> <br /> I just want to avoid everyone being Batman and just happening to carry any given mundane item at any given time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T12:47:11-07:00","id":270304,"title":"","content":"Here is a preliminary list.<br /> <br /> <b>Hunting/Eating</b><br /> Boning Knife<br /> Knife Sharpener<br /> Mess Kit<br /> Cook Kit<br /> Meat Bags<br /> Meat Saw<br /> Canteen<br /> Spices<br /> Salt<br /> Lime Juice<br /> <br /> <b>Cold Weather</b><br /> snow/Rain Gear<br /> Heavy Fur Coat<br /> Blanket<br /> Cold Weather Clothing (One for wearing, one extra in dry bag)<br /> Dry bag<br /> Gloves<br /> Ice Pick<br /> Snow Shoes<br /> Ice climbing feet spikes and other ice climbing equipment<br /> boots<br /> <br /> <b>Misc</b><br /> Sewing Kit<br /> Torch/lantern<br /> candles/matches<br /> Toilet Items<br /> small hygiene items<br /> First Aid Kit<br /> Rope<br /> Flint and Steel<br /> Ax<br /> Back pack<br /> walking stick<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Shelter</b><br /> Ground Cloth<br /> Sleeping Bag<br /> Tent<br /> Patch Kit for Tent<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>My character</b><br /> Basic Repair Kit for Lore repair checks<br /> Breaking and entering kit for larceny checks<br /> Small Mirror<br /> chalk<br /> Compass/Map (Does a compass work in creation?)<br /> Flask of Local Alcohol<br /> Journal/pencils (in dry bag)<br /> Bow<br /> Armor<br /> Arrows<br /> Bow Repair Kit<br /> Armor Maintenance kit<br /> Stuff to make things go boom","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 10-01-2014, 03:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T13:01:50-07:00","id":270311,"title":"","content":"compasses point toward the elemental pole of earth not north in creation making them actually more reliable","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T13:18:39-07:00","id":270317,"title":"","content":"I feel I should mention that the airship I was going to ask for was essentially a tiny blimp made of many....MANY flammable materials. Not an artifact. The Haslanti learned how to make them from some disguised Lunars and now have a bigger airfleet than the Realm and Lookshy combined.<br /> <br /> In other news, I have redone my character concept. It's still pretty much the same but instead of having an airship he now runs a Physician's Office that doubles as a secret shrine to the Unconquered Sun in whatever city or town is going to feature prominantly for us. I have no doubt that it'll end up being moved from town to town as/if we move around. I also plan to have a dot of Followers who are people the Zenith's picked up either from his military days or shortly after exalting. They act as his assistants and students and also function as priests for the shrine. He still has his Dragon-Blooded bro Allies dot. I'm thinking an Earth or Fire Aspect but I'm not positive. The dragon-blooded should act as a pal that helps to keep the Zenith grounded.<br /> <br /> I'll have a character sheet posted this afternoon when I get off from work. Would you prefer a Google docs link or a copy/paste post from Word?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T13:57:14-07:00","id":270343,"title":"","content":"Since we're showing characters<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/file/d/0B_bGakUT9OwNU2FzdWNrWU1mYTQ/edit\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/file/d/0B_bG...NrWU1mYTQ/edit</a> for character<br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1j0oZOEvK-ZjMgBEH6KXO71-_035I2K2STd5VAXAUYGA/edit\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...5VAXAUYGA/edit</a> for equipment and miscellaneous","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T14:11:30-07:00","id":270351,"title":"","content":"I don't have permission to view the google docs. There should be a way to post view only link from Google Drive.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T14:14:17-07:00","id":270352,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrBojangles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=270317#post270317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'll have a character sheet posted this afternoon when I get off from work. Would you prefer a Google docs link or a copy/paste post from Word?</div> </div> </div> </div>whatever works for you honestly","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T14:40:53-07:00","id":270366,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=270351#post270351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't have permission to view the google docs. There should be a way to post view only link from Google Drive.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fixed, never really messed with Google docs before","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T17:22:52-07:00","id":270507,"title":"","content":"Alright here is my guy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0XSxTfAd8vJeWN6eUNxbjBVMjQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0XSxTfAd8vJeWN6eUNxbjBVMjQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0XSxTfAd8vJeWN6eUNxbjBVMjQ/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0XSxTfAd8vJeWN6eUNxbjBVMjQ/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As far as equipment, I'm not sure yet. It's been awhile since I've made a big ole equipment list DnD style. I'll work on it and post it up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T18:33:33-07:00","id":270522,"title":"","content":"Here's a quick equipment list: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1T8198tp77KPiVfycPbn96jPX7Hey5wmbv6ci_xwNNpY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> And a picture: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0XSxTfAd8vJdDFVZ0YxTXpjdGM/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0X...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Based on the equipment list and picture, I made some small changes to the character sheet. Mostly cosmetic, although I did get a Chain Shirt: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0XSxTfAd8vJVXJVU1FmRW5weGs/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B0X...it?usp=sharing</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T18:53:16-07:00","id":270526,"title":"","content":"Sweet embrace of Erembour but i wish i could get into this game. i would play a Lunar sorceress. (Ye gads! cross gender roleplaying, the horror!)<br /> <br /> But my schedual is so fluid. i normally have either tuesday and wednsday off or wed, thur off, and i work from noon to 9ish and usually get home about 10pm arizona time (pacific-ish)<br /> <br /> Alas i fear my schedual will never sync. if it IS possible for me to get in, let me know and maybe i'll whip up that Lunar.<br /> <br /> And for the record, no mote regen for stunting is a good house rule. it limits the use of charms to something resembling reason and forces players to think outside of their charms from time to time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/779-nusoardgraphite","name":"NuSoardGraphite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar779_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T19:11:47-07:00","id":270527,"title":"","content":"So I entered my character into Anathema and it found two extra bonus points. I put them into Socialize and Dodge. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-UiWxItb8fkdzJzaEw1NmJycDA/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Updated Character Sheet</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1egBPDzN3bBp7P8p_cJVXhdx1iAynd4E-a4yE8koDoaY/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Equipment List</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-UiWxItb8fkMy1KMXlibG85SFE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Character Potrait</a> - Thanks to the Exaltification Thread. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T19:41:15-07:00","id":270537,"title":"","content":"Do....do we all have Red Rage of Compassion?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T19:50:32-07:00","id":270539,"title":"","content":"I don't : P I just have to worry about the neverborn destroying everything I've ever cared about","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T20:09:23-07:00","id":270543,"title":"","content":"Always fun. Are using the standard rules Abyssal Limit (i forget what it's called) or the variant in Shards?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-01T20:12:31-07:00","id":270545,"title":"","content":"No idea, I don't own shards so I don't know what the variants are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T08:24:50-07:00","id":270820,"title":"","content":"The variant in Shards of the Exalted Dream (p. 133) is similar to how Virtue Flaws work for Solars. You pick a &quot;Doom&quot; based on your main Virtue. Abyssals also have &quot;Resonance Bleed&quot;, which are environmental effects that appear as your character gains resonance. At low levels, candles will blow out as your character passes, gamblers will have a string of bad luck, and your character's appearance will appear more &quot;spooky&quot;. At higher levels, plants will wither and die, holy symbols will tarnish or crack,. If someone sleeps near the Abyssal, they could have nightmares featuring the abyssal. These effects are cumulative. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T08:35:20-07:00","id":270823,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrBojangles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=270537#post270537\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do....do we all have Red Rage of Compassion?</div> </div> </div> </div>I was going to go the Conviction Route, but I needed more room for Intimacies. Though apparently I read that section wrong and you add your will power to your compassion for the number of Intimacies.<br /> <br /> We will see how it goes. I had this idea for a custom conviction flaw based on Kleptomania. Basically, my character feels that she is the best person to make use of an artifact, power, etc and will try to take it from the &quot;less worthy&quot; person. Partial control would mean that she uses social or stealth to take what she wants. I couldn't figure out a limit condition with a happy balance between &quot;this flaw will never gain limit&quot; and &quot;I'm limit breaking every other game&quot;.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T09:19:17-07:00","id":270854,"title":"","content":"I found a variant Compassion flaw that I was thinking about putting forward. White Knight Heroism. Essentially you go out of your way to save people from bad situations. Any time you can't or something happens that you could have saved some one from but didn't, you gain limit. When you Break, you HAVE to save people. Everyone, in whatever way you can, regardless of the consequences to yourself. It's like a very active variant on Heart of Tears' passivity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T09:52:42-07:00","id":270873,"title":"","content":"Just using standard resonance because I'm not a fan of limit in any of its forms. It rarely ever comes into play, when it does players can easily mitigate the damage. Like once a player hit their limit and was crying in a corner, ok the players left him at home while they did their thing and came back when he was done. All it did was boot out a player for a scene. Its rare you limit break, even rarer that it matters. Basically it will still be there but gonna be lax on it. I'm more ok with resonance but only when the GM controls it and can thus choose times and effects that are actual issues.<br /> <br /> Alternatively if you guys like limit, you could hand control of it to me. Your Red Rage of Compassion will hit, but it wont hit when you are fighting a band of murderous bandits, no it will hit when you see a school kid being bullied and now need to explain to a town how you totally aren't a horrible demon possessed human despite just disembowling three children.<br /> <br /> Have fun<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://smg.photobucket.com/user/aerozord/media/skyrimhavefun_zps0ebd4c17.jpg.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v135/aerozord/skyrimhavefun_zps0ebd4c17.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a><br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=270823#post270823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was going to go the Conviction Route, but I needed more room for Intimacies. Though apparently I read that section wrong and you add your will power to your compassion for the number of Intimacies.<br /> <br /> We will see how it goes. I had this idea for a custom conviction flaw based on Kleptomania. Basically, my character feels that she is the best person to make use of an artifact, power, etc and will try to take it from the &quot;less worthy&quot; person. Partial control would mean that she uses social or stealth to take what she wants. I couldn't figure out a limit condition with a happy balance between &quot;this flaw will never gain limit&quot; and &quot;I'm limit breaking every other game&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Ok what if someone has something, but I want it more, so I take it&quot;<br /> &quot;No, thats illegal&quot;<br /> &quot;wait, what!? That doesn't make any sense. I WANT it more.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T10:21:52-07:00","id":270895,"title":"","content":"I think the Resonance mechanic in Shards works better than the Limit mechanic in the core book. I really like the Resonance Bleed idea, but core book limit is a very wonky mechanic to me. On paper I understand that they are trying to recreate the heroic flaws of mythic heroes, I've never been in a game were anyone reached their limit. <br /> <br /> I'm going to stick with Red Rage of Compassion, since we are already past the deadline for characters. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T10:31:42-07:00","id":270903,"title":"","content":"I do really dig the Resonance variants in Shards, but it would be a hell of a job adapting it to Solars. I've always enjoyed Limit and Virtue Flaws when they act as natural extensions of the character. The true horror of Limit Break is that it seems like something the character in question might do if pushed far enough. But no one dreams he would ever be pushed that far.<br /> <br /> No one thinks Superman would just give up. No one dreams that Captain America would lose his bearing. You don't think that Samurai Jack would be that imprudent. But it could happen if someone or something pushed them far enough. The insanity of the Great Curse is that generally no one realizes what the exalted is doing is out of character.....even the exalted in question. Remember, it feels GOOD to Break. Hence all the awesome bonus Willpower.<br /> <br /> But I am going so far off topic that I ended up in Wyld. So to get back on topic, how do the Character Sheets look? Anything screwy we need to change? Would you mind me changing to that White Knight Heroism if I define it further just to give us some variety?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T10:36:30-07:00","id":270907,"title":"","content":"As long as your not a stickler for resonance, it can raise retardedly fast if a ST really wants it to. Admittedly Bloodless is doing a few things that's kind of asking for it.<br /> <br /> p.s. found out my ravaging blow owl seizes mouse combo doesn't work like I wanted : c","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T10:45:22-07:00","id":270942,"title":"","content":"I haven't read the Abyssal stuff in a while. What is/does it suppose to do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T11:03:52-07:00","id":270956,"title":"","content":"We will discuss it tomorrow. Agreeing on how to handle limit wont change the character sheets so don't worry about it. I prefer resonance over limit because with a heroic character its hard to work with it. Trying to do good but doing good causes harm.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrBojangles</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=270942#post270942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven't read the Abyssal stuff in a while. What is/does it suppose to do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Basically if you do good stuff, you accumulate resonance. Eventually it erupts and injures you, or makes your deathly supernatural nature obvious, or hurts those you care about. The idea is it makes it difficult to live among the living. The Neverborn want those abyssals that defy their dark fate to become jaded and broken until they give in to their nature as engines of destruction. Sadly many players game this system, like limit, and even use it to their advantage. I have even seen players intentionally trigger limit break for the willpower boost","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T11:08:46-07:00","id":270957,"title":"","content":"Well that sucks. The players gaming limit not resonance. Although that sucks, too but for in game reasons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T11:14:57-07:00","id":270962,"title":"","content":"To be fair the people who vent branding or blight to that effect get punished way harder than what benefit it gives. Its a beacon for heaven and at least 4 Deathlords to what you're doing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T15:36:07-07:00","id":271139,"title":"","content":"Are we using combos? I thought we were using the errata...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T16:03:57-07:00","id":271158,"title":"","content":"combo's still exist in the errata if only in name, non-social &quot;combos&quot; are still automatically obvious for example","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T16:33:47-07:00","id":271186,"title":"","content":"Ok to be clear, the errata rules state you can use charms freely as if they were part of a combo, IE you dont need to make custom ones. Takes willpower, is obvious, charms need to be combo-ok ect. I still encourage pseudo-making them so you can still have your cool moves, and ideally yell them out anime style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T17:55:53-07:00","id":271258,"title":"","content":"And, the sheet for my character:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Bw_kLDAvk555WnptQnJhc0tyc3c/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Bw_kLDAvk555WnptQnJhc0tyc3c/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Bw_kLDAvk555WnptQnJhc0tyc3c/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/file/d/0Bw_kLDAvk555WnptQnJhc0tyc3c/view?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3104,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","user":"Spaaace","date":".  Updated to include Essence. 10-03-2014, 08:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-02T19:31:57-07:00","id":271290,"title":"","content":"So no xp needed to buy combos?<br /> <br /> Edit: just read the errata. Now I can spend my Xp on dodge charms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 10-02-2014, 10:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T07:29:46-07:00","id":271610,"title":"","content":"We will be playing today, or at the very least getting things settled in. Game will start at 8pm EST. If there is anything else last minute feel free to share","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T10:41:18-07:00","id":271650,"title":"","content":"Are we using Revlid's craft revision for artifacts/charms or RAW? The main reason I ask is because RAW artifact crafting is borderline antagonistic to other players. I've always felt the ingredients should be the hard part not &quot;can you guys wait a few years for me to finish this?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T11:03:49-07:00","id":271655,"title":"","content":"Neither, I addressed this already but I'll give the basics. Just having &quot;mundane&quot; crafting then the various supernatural flavors. I want crafting artifacts to be an emphasis on esoteric nature of it. Though far warning, not gonna let you just wyld shape whatever the hell you want. In fact I want to make magic materials something you have to steal or create because honestly the idea of the group doing a freakin heist movie style robbery of a jade cache sounds awesome","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3945,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","user":"Aeroz","date":". 10-03-2014, 02:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T11:32:55-07:00","id":271658,"title":"","content":"So, what sort of crafting times are we looking at? I'm assuming that a power bow will take less time than say an Air ship.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T11:35:55-07:00","id":271659,"title":"","content":"I dont want to set hard limits. Like you said a powerbow, once you have the stuff it should take a few days if not hours. An airship by yourself, yes months with charms, years without.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T11:39:43-07:00","id":271665,"title":"","content":"Don't forget Tomb Raiding<span style=\"font-size:8px\"><sup>TM</sup><span style=\"font-size:11px\">. <span style=\"font-size:12px\">I hear that's all the rage these days. And according to Skyrim, ancient frozen wastes are filled with em.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T11:49:15-07:00","id":271667,"title":"","content":"That works for me. I'm perfectly okay with the airship or similar large artifact being a major project. <br /> <br /> Eura, with the ST rulings on crafting, I think I will have my character pick up some crafting. Probably focus on weapons and magitech. <br /> <br /> Though I need to pick up some Dodge and Archery charms first. Right now, I'm relying on the two martial artists to be meat shields, so my wussy Twilight doesn't get hurt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T12:08:16-07:00","id":271672,"title":"","content":"Oh don't worry. We've all got some character growth to go through before we can really get going. I still need like 5 charms and a dot of essence before my dude matches to the baseline in my head. One of which is Heaven Thunder Hammer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T12:24:52-07:00","id":271681,"title":"","content":"huh, two crafters this can only end in ruin","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":".  spelling 10-03-2014, 03:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T13:04:46-07:00","id":271700,"title":"","content":"I think it will end in airship, not ruin....<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.history.com/s3static/video-thumbnails/AETN-History_Prod/73/828/History_Speeches_6000_Eyewitness_Hindenberg_Disaster_still_624x352.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> Opps. Maybe we are both right...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T16:34:26-07:00","id":271855,"title":"","content":"I sent a contact request to the aerozord located in ohio. That is you right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-03T16:59:35-07:00","id":271867,"title":"","content":"should be, though I didn't get one. just add both, sort it out later<br /> <br /> also guys, starting in just a few minutes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T00:59:23-07:00","id":272099,"title":"","content":"Best lines of the night:<br /> <br /> &quot;I could always use Whispers and try.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You are going to ask the Neverborn how to make Hot Cocoa?&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> Also, we really need a Eclipse Caste. Just so my character doesn't get ripped off anymore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T08:38:53-07:00","id":272242,"title":"","content":"Question about craft. What sort of craft rating/speciality will I need to make the following items?<br /> <br /> Chain shirt (artifact 1)<br /> <br /> diaklave (artifact 2)<br /> <br /> Power bow (artifact 3)<br /> <br /> Air boat (artifact 4)<br /> <br /> Cache egg (artifact 1-4)<br /> <br /> Discrete essence armor (artifact 2)<br /> <br /> I'm trying to get an idea of what craft I need to take to make different types of artifacts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T13:02:23-07:00","id":272448,"title":"","content":"I had a great time last night. It was a lot of fun!<br /> <br /> However... I can't make a habit of 2am finish times. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Can we aim for an 8:00-midnight timeframe per session? Since we're meeting weekly, we should make good progress.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T17:14:11-07:00","id":272584,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with 12 am stop time. 3 am was a bit brutal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-04T17:38:59-07:00","id":272593,"title":"","content":"game ran abit long though we also spent a decent chunk of it getting settled. I'll aim for a midnight (EST) stop time though<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=272242#post272242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Question about craft. What sort of craft rating/speciality will I need to make the following items?<br /> <br /> Chain shirt (artifact 1)<br /> <br /> diaklave (artifact 2)<br /> <br /> Power bow (artifact 3)<br /> <br /> Air boat (artifact 4)<br /> <br /> Cache egg (artifact 1-4)<br /> <br /> Discrete essence armor (artifact 2)<br /> <br /> I'm trying to get an idea of what craft I need to take to make different types of artifacts.</div> </div> </div> </div>You'll need atleast 3 dots of craft mundane before you start dipping into magitech. You might still need more mundane for some of the finer details depending on what you are making. As for magitech you will need [artifact rating +2] to craft the item. So you'd need 5 dots in magitech to make a power bow. The actual crafting will require magic materials and exotic ingredients that have esoteric value. Exotic ingredients depend on what you are going for. It would be something that conceptually matches what you are making. Example from that story I told you guys, using the first sword crafted by someone that eventually became a solar artificer worked well for making a daiklaive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-05T10:31:53-07:00","id":273051,"title":"","content":"Awesome. I got a couple of ideas for crafting projects, but if any of the other plays have an item the want to craft, let me know.<br /> <br /> With that said, I decided to not take crafting right now and took the 2nd Dodge Excellency instead. I figured that I can pick up craft ability points with the smaller amounts of normal XP we will be getting.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-UiWxItb8fkdzJzaEw1NmJycDA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a> is my updated character sheet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T08:18:51-07:00","id":273838,"title":"","content":"Ok guys I had an idea but not so sure if its a good one. I thought up a way for you guys to accomplish much of what you want, but at a cost. Normally I think its best to start off with a &quot;yes we are awesome&quot; moment because this is Exalted. However this arc escalated quickly from &quot;lets get hot cocoa&quot; to &quot;secrete plot to commit genocide&quot;. I feel like to stop something so epic in such a short time should require abit of sacrifice. I just dont want you guys to feel like the ST is going to be beating you down all campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T10:27:56-07:00","id":274011,"title":"","content":"I wasn't thinking that we'd be able to stop the whole genocide plot quickly (Unless, you don't want to spend a lot of time on this). Before, it was just a few sick villagers. I figured we beat up a god and call it a day. Now, we will probably have to visit the Ice Walkers and maybe blow up some trains (or something). And of course we need to get our Abyssal back. He might be a creepy guy, but he is OUR creepy guy.<br /> <br /> Any who, the whole problem was that we need to get out of town to avoid the wyld hunt. This plot seems to headed towards us needing to get out of town to solve it. Maybe give the village god a ring on his blackberry to let him know we are still solving the issue, not running out on him.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, I'm okay with Mayu being beat down. I've played Call of Cthulhu. Our characters are new at this whole &quot;being awesome&quot; thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 10-06-2014, 01:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T11:15:41-07:00","id":274053,"title":"","content":"Found a reference picture for the Bartender<div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://simg3.gelbooru.com//images/17/96/1796cdba524a3eb4f4f8b79de1b3f8ef.jpg?1630560\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T11:21:18-07:00","id":274056,"title":"","content":"Never trust a skinny bartender....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T12:31:19-07:00","id":274108,"title":"","content":"Well, the poisoning plot seems to have been largely resolved. We know and can prove what was killing the townsfolk. We can go to the town's spirit and demand that he hold up his end of the deal (to throw the Wyld Hunt off our trail if we discover/stop what's making the people sick). Even if that bartender comes back, the town will be warned. Of course, his brew is super-addictive, so maybe they won't be able to resist?<br /> <br /> In any case, we should still get out of town because of the the Wyld Hunt. We also need to figure out where Bloodless went and how to get him out of there. I thought we would head north to find the source of the poison as our best lead to do that (which might also put a more permanent stop to the sickness if we can cut off the supply). Plus Baldur might be affected by the poison, so he should be interested in finding a cure if there is one.<br /> <br /> As an aside, I likely won't be able to make it this Friday. It's Thanksgiving weekend and we will be having company. =) <br /> <br /> Feel free to play Alric as a background character/NPC/Night-caste-on-a-stick this week and try not to get him killed. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T13:25:32-07:00","id":274135,"title":"","content":"That shouldn't be an issue, can have him back gathering supplies while the rest rush on to try and find a lead on what happened to Bloodless","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-06T13:31:08-07:00","id":274140,"title":"","content":"I was really confused until I googled not everyone celebrates thanksgiving in November.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T17:56:12-07:00","id":275910,"title":"","content":"So a few of you guys are interested in crafting, and if you recall I said I'm not going to let you just wyld shape magic materials. For this reason would you guys like to raid a cache, search for a lost deposit, negotiate a trade, build your own refinery?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T19:10:56-07:00","id":275976,"title":"","content":"all of the above potentially at the same time. Re-reading the martial art styles, when/if I get to the point of wanting a second style I'm really tempted to just make my own, very few actually use gauntlets and even fewer allow armor since I was eventually going iron kettle/real armor combo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T19:15:25-07:00","id":275980,"title":"","content":"All of the above? Probably in that order? <br /> <br /> I see my character eventually moving away from the Scavenger Lord and into building her own stuff. Maybe even funneling materials/magitech that any of the other PCs don't want to Lookshy somehow. Of course being a Scavenger Lord is a good cover for having all this magitech without attracting too much attention. &quot;Yeah, I totally find this Power Bow in an old ruin. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-08T20:11:28-07:00","id":276017,"title":"","content":"I do have a few ideas but I want to wait until we resolve the immediate so I have a better idea of what you guys want before mentioning it<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=275976#post275976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">all of the above potentially at the same time. Re-reading the martial art styles, when/if I get to the point of wanting a second style I'm really tempted to just make my own, very few actually use gauntlets and even fewer allow armor since I was eventually going iron kettle/real armor combo.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just keep theme in mind. There is a reason there aren't many fighting styles with gauntlets and armor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T06:03:09-07:00","id":276221,"title":"","content":"<i>Marvel</i>ous Hulk Smash Style? =D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T06:12:38-07:00","id":276223,"title":"","content":"I would also like to mention, that I would be interested in finding actual artifacts too. I know we got the lock box, but I don't want to rule out Tomb Raiding. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T11:41:37-07:00","id":276532,"title":"","content":"So you know if you want tomb raiding your best bet is the barren wasteland beyond the white sea. Very few go there and the ice would cover up lost treasures. One reason I said I was holding back on mentioning ideas is I dont know if your characters will want to venture out over the ice sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T11:46:58-07:00","id":276535,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with going out on the ice sheet. I didn't want to start the game on the ice sheet. I figured it would be an expedition with sled dogs and the like that would need to be prepared for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T15:21:47-07:00","id":276696,"title":"","content":"I must admit, since its almost halloween and you guys are going to the frozen north. Was tempted to try and figure out a way to have you run across The Thing (as in the movie)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T17:40:35-07:00","id":276852,"title":"","content":"I was planning on more civilization based shenanigans, personally. We should save Bloodless, but otherwise I was heading south for a reason. Not many bars, or barmaids in the frozen north.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T19:16:34-07:00","id":276912,"title":"","content":"I don't think the game should be 100% on the ice. There will be plenty of time for both scavenging ancient ruins and wooing bar maids in civilization. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, I doubt I'll be reuniting with my character's brother out on the ice (He is Mayu's ally). Out of character, I have a good reason to stay in civilization.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 10-09-2014, 10:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-09T20:14:18-07:00","id":276936,"title":"","content":"In the immediate future you will be in civilized areas. Before you can get to the ice sheet you'll need to go past the most densely populated region of the North.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-10T16:08:22-07:00","id":277662,"title":"","content":"Just a reminder guys, game in less than one hour","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-10T19:59:15-07:00","id":277779,"title":"","content":"Here are the stories I was talking about<b></b>:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://archive.org/stream/TheMostDangerousGame_129/danger.txt\" target=\"_blank\">The Most Dangerous Game</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.eastoftheweb.com/short-stories/UBooks/LadyTige.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">The Lady and the Tiger</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T01:20:34-07:00","id":277976,"title":"","content":"Just warning you guys, I'm going to be generating a metric shit ton of agro next session so the name of the game might be keeping them from overwhelming me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-11T09:52:31-07:00","id":278192,"title":"","content":"I will recap next week but for the sake of our missing players.<br /> <br /> The group found bloodless, who found himself with The Bartender, a ghost, and a moonshadow. To try and get the ice walkers to fight these people they went off to try and do an impressive feat to earn their respect. They found a pit of living but crippled ice walkers. Soon discovering what did it, naked humans with claws, who now have you guys surrounded.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;ba