:"We burned down the train station, Balder and Bloodless jumped on the DOOM Train and were somewhat holding your own until the Ghost showed up and back stabbed Bloodless. Mayu fell off a horse while trying to shot arrows and Alric dodge a big explosive Rune while trying to catch up with the others on the train. <br /> <br /> We made a tactical retreat and the damn bartender waved good bye off the back of the train as we ran off with our tails between our legs. But we burned down the train station, so they won't be able to supply their &quot;special ingredient&quot; to poison everyone for a while. We might have freaked out the Ice Walkers, because we were the bad asses who killed the Creatures from the Wyld. So if something could send us running, they MUST be scary powerful.<br /> <br /> Our next stop is gear up in the city/town that Mayu has her place and head to the Ice Sheet to find this Factory Cathedral. The idea is that we are going to need more artifacts/experience to take down the bartender and his friends. If Balder has any input on future plans, feel free to chime in. <br /> <br /> I keep bringing up our dear Dragon Blooded Allies, but the ST keeps changing the Subject. He did mention taking a look at the DB book, so there might be hope. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> We got four extra XP for completing the story line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-10T13:14:09-08:00","id":308478,"title":"","content":"You and I jumped on top of the train to face embers directly, turns out npc Baldur sucks at fighting, managed to throw her off the train (kinda), Korac got a really good backstab on me (don't worry I can heal it in a day with charms) and decided to retreat because while we might have taken him, he heralded eventual reinforcements. Mayu realized she couldn't ride a horse and decided to fall face first in the snow while chasing said train. I'd say a solid c in terms of success because we royally messed up the station to actually return but the train is still functional. The group realized its not ready to fight the forces of death head on so we decided we're going to the alleged factory cathedral. Because the first arc has ended we all got a bonus 4 exp (including you).<br /> <br /> stupid ninjas","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":". 11-10-2014, 04:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T14:45:08-08:00","id":309492,"title":"","content":"We meeting Thursday or Friday?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-11T21:54:12-08:00","id":309863,"title":"","content":"sorry sorry. to be honest I've just been distracted the