t respite while I get food. Shouldn't be an issue, will give people time to settle in<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T05:50:51-08:00","id":312884,"title":"","content":"And so, how did it go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T06:44:08-08:00","id":312894,"title":"","content":"Only Eura and I were at game. We met up with Mayu's Dragon Blooded older brother, who is very suspicious of the fact that his little sister is traveling with three large and muscular men. He helped get us some supplies and what not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T07:55:12-08:00","id":312958,"title":"","content":"I was totally helping","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T08:10:28-08:00","id":312964,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=312958#post312958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was totally helping</div> </div> </div> </div>yea he totally didn't lose all his money gambling on dice","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T08:15:39-08:00","id":312967,"title":"","content":"And all those comments on staying up all night and needing sleep TOTALLY helped Mayu convince her brother she wasn't sleeping with any of these men she is traveling with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T10:52:55-08:00","id":313083,"title":"","content":"it was an amusing session, Was rather nice to see Mayu interacting with her brother","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T14:23:52-08:00","id":313296,"title":"","content":"Alric isn't large and muscular, he's lithe and handsome! =)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-15T17:16:03-08:00","id":313370,"title":"","content":"We checked everyone's character sheet and Bloodless had the highest Appearance Score. We figured Alric seduced Women with his charm and wisely turned his charm off when Mayu's Brother was looking for a target for his suspicions. Also, the Abyssal does fit the &quot;bad boy&quot; motif. Too bad that isn't Mayu's type. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Looking back, I find it hilarious that Mayu was all worried about Makoto finding out that she was a Solar. Being a Solar didn't even phase her brother; her camping out with all these men did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-15-2014, 08:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-16T21:19:23-08:00","id":314189,"title":"","content":"Roll call, who can make the game this week?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T06:43:02-08:00","id":314421,"title":"","content":"I'll be there. I can make Thursday or Friday night, if we need to change the date.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-17T08:16:40-08:00","id":314514,"title":"","content":"I'll be there. I'm solo-parenting bedtime, so there might be a few distractions from 8:00-8:30, but it shouldn't be a problem.<br /> <br /> As for Alric - yes, he gets by on his charisma (and manipulation) and socialize.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T09:01:53-08:00","id":315451,"title":"","content":"Friday at 8pm EST if everyone is ok with it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-18T20:55:24-08:00","id":315875,"title":"","content":"Unfortunately I cannot.....again. I'm driving to St Louis on Friday afternoon. I swear I'm not doing this on purpose!! I had no idea my Fridays would be this weird when we started.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1499-mrbojangles","name":"MrBojangles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1499_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T07:38:19-08:00","id":316259,"title":"","content":"Remember guys while I won't be there if you can scrounge up materials Bloodless can build stuff for you. Preferably stuff that hurts other people so I can build it 15 times faster. Oh that reminds me Bloodless does commission portraits because menial labor sucks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T08:08:50-08:00","id":316288,"title":"","content":"I think Mayu going to stick around town for a while, with all the rumors of demons. As much as she wants to head to the ice sheet, she would want to check the whole demon thing out. Mostly because she doesn't want to come back from the possible factory cathedral with her home in flames.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T08:28:03-08:00","id":316313,"title":"","content":"I'm looking forward to some civilization time for Alric. Re-supply, bathe, drink, carouse and repeat! Maybe find something worth stealing. =D","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T08:29:22-08:00","id":316314,"title":"","content":"Bet you won't steal the frozen sword from that one person who kills people horribly for trying.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T08:35:21-08:00","id":316315,"title":"","content":"Seriously. Mayu tried to buy it from her, but the lady wasn't selling. In other news, I need to spend more XP on Bureaucracy. <br /> <br /> Does Mayu know that Alric is a thief?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T08:45:14-08:00","id":316321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=316314#post316314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bet you won't steal the frozen sword from that one person who kills people horribly for trying.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds epic. I'm in!<br /> <br /> @Mayu<br /> <br /> We haven't had many of those slice of life moments where such things might have come up, but Alric should come across as a pretty shady guy and he's Night caste so that should probably tell you something about him. If asked about the Orichalcum daiklaves he uses or why he doesn't want to go to Gethamane, he might have even mentioned that they were liberated from their previous owners who might possibly have sent Dragon Blooded mercenaries to retrieve them (the reason he's sticking with our little motley crew).<br /> <br /> There's also the incident where he unlocked and stole something from a first age safe out from under the noses of a tribe of Icewalkers and an Abyssal exalted in the same room. We can bridge that gap pretty easily if it means we get to go steal something cool. =) (Geddit? Frozen swords are cool!)<br /> <br /> So, while not explicitly stated with accompanying business card, that he's a thief in addition to his carousing and womanizing shouldn't come as a shock. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T08:52:35-08:00","id":316326,"title":"","content":"I forgot about the First Age Safe! So she totally knows he is a thief. <br /> <br /> I think the best part of last game was that we had some Slice of Life RP moments. Haven't had too many of those in the past few games with all the combat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T12:13:43-08:00","id":316437,"title":"","content":"So what is the background on the lady and her sword?<br /> <br /> ie. What happened last game?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T12:35:45-08:00","id":316444,"title":"","content":"We don't know much about her. She is just some lady walking around with an awesome short sword made of some unknown material that may be magical. Mayu talked to her and offered to buy her sword. The woman didn't take Mayu's offer.<br /> <br /> From the conversation, she really doesn't understand what she has, but realizes there is a lot of interest in the sword. Thus she is protective of the sword and so far seems to be able to handle any thieves that have tried to take it via force.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T12:40:20-08:00","id":316445,"title":"","content":"Other things that happened last game, besides Mayu's brother showing up and Bloodless losing money:<br /> <br /> -Mayu has an old lady living in her apartment building that knows First Age cookie Recipes<br /> -Bloodless tried to ask about any Wyld Hunt activity in the area at the local guild hall. He wasn't too stealthy about it though.<br /> -There are demons raiding the country side, harassing travelers, etc. There seems to be no pattern to what the demons are doing or the type of demons causing trouble.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T16:55:53-08:00","id":316639,"title":"","content":"Any word on what happened to the other people who tried to take the sword? Is she an Exalt?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T17:13:22-08:00","id":316705,"title":"","content":"I assumed that the woman with the sword gave them a major beating. None of the PCs have seen this in person though. No clue if she is an Exalt or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-19T19:10:42-08:00","id":316825,"title":"","content":"right now I'm mostly trying to sow story seeds and poke some plot hooks because I dont want anything major happening when half the group is missing. Think I got abit more set up in me though.","signa