itle":"","content":"More like the big thing is who she slept with.<br /> <br /> OH and I almost forgot, next session you guys are having dinner with the cookie lady","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T08:15:50-08:00","id":320717,"title":"","content":"Yes, dinner with the nice cookie lady.<br /> <br /> And Alric managed to win a &quot;Polar Bear Dog&quot; mount via gambling. Also, they gamble with artifacts in this town. Something to keep in mind for the future.<br /> <br /> Also, would it be possible for Mayu to get a pot of stew from one of the food stands in town? She really can't cook much more than bacon and eggs and coffee. She can brew a mean cup of coffee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 11-24-2014, 11:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T08:30:50-08:00","id":320746,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=320717#post320717\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Also, would it be possible for Mayu to get a pot of stew from one of the food stands in town? She really can't cook much more than bacon and eggs and coffee. She can brew a mean cup of coffee.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm going to say yes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T12:18:36-08:00","id":320989,"title":"","content":"Alric went out of his way to imply to Mayu's brother that they're sleeping together (they're not). Hilarity ensued!<br /> <br /> I got to roll 18 dice on a gambling roll. Don't ever gamble with the Exalted. This got me a mount worthy of the ice sheet (a Polar Bear/Dog mixed critter) and a boatload of cash.<br /> <br /> There was a Lunar who showed up in town and the lady with the sword lopped off three of his limbs in two cuts (one arm, both legs; totally <b>not</b> gonna try to steal the sword).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T12:33:25-08:00","id":321000,"title":"","content":"The day that Mayu and Makoto (yes, Mayu's brother has a name) find out that Alric can understand Riverspeak should be interesti