":383660,"title":"","content":"Quick question, wouldn't sparing Beeno's life give me resonance or does subjugating him let me off the hook?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T15:48:43-08:00","id":383703,"title":"","content":"Honestly, yea you should gain resonance. But it was my bad for forgetting it.<br /> <br /> As a quick reminder no game this week","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-02T22:17:11-08:00","id":391045,"title":"","content":"Ok I'm back guys, reminding you we will be playing this week at 8pm EST (or abit later if player parenting responsibilities need to be filled first)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T07:36:19-08:00","id":391418,"title":"","content":"Yay! So about this first age bank we are going to rob....<br /> <br /> Sorry, we have been talking about robbing a bank since game started so I am excited (though I sure we are going to get our butts handed to us). :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T07:44:57-08:00","id":391427,"title":"","content":"I'm not really sure how banking works in Exalted, let alone a first age bank. My plan was to go in, take a look around, maybe open an account to gather some information.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T13:09:22-08:00","id":391778,"title":"","content":"In exalted banks are more of a place of safety and convenience for the wealthy. They allow you to withdraw from accounts regardless of where you are and also handle things such as currency exchanges. This means what a bank tends to hold is raw valuables such as gold, silver, and jade. A first age bank, well your characters dont know for certain.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T14:07:59-08:00","id":391833,"title":"","content":"Dibs on the first hard mote we find","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T07:16:19-08:00","id":392573,"title":"","content":"Here's hoping they don't shoot us on sight.<br /> <br /> We're probably going to have to figure out the mimic slime problem before too long, as well.<br /> <br /> How many days do we have left before we need to get going back to the ship?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T07:34:41-08:00","id":392579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeroz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=391778#post391778\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In exalted banks are more of a place of safety and convenience for the wealthy. They allow you to withdraw from accounts regardless of where you are and also handle things such as currency exchanges. This means what a bank tends to hold is raw valuables such as gold, silver, and jade. A first age bank, well your characters dont know for certain.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mayu would be so pissed if we spend all that effort breaking into a bank and all we find is the Exalted equivalent of Confederate Currency. Though I suppose we could us that money on items and services in the city.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T16:56:35-08:00","id":394286,"title":"","content":"Look at what I found at local gaming store:<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/file/d/0B-UiWxItb8fkd0tLTHhnX1FqUDA/edit?usp=docslist_api\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/file/d/0B-Ui...p=docslist_api</a><br /> <br /> Figured it was worth it since we will be playing 2nd edition for a while.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-05T18:45:16-08:00","id":394346,"title":"","content":"I have a friend here in Houston that may be interested in joining our Exalted game. Difficulty is that he has never played an RPG before (he has played many, many board games). You guys up for having an inexperienced player join our group?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","