950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T19:05:56-07:00","id":443539,"title":"","content":"Its worth five","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T09:48:35-07:00","id":450535,"title":"","content":"We be playing tonight at 8pm? Sans Alric?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T10:43:52-07:00","id":450582,"title":"","content":"yes, yes we are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T23:05:25-07:00","id":451328,"title":"","content":"So talked with Aeroz and he's been wanting us to post how our characters think about npc's so here goes:<br /> <br /> Reaper: Embodies everything I hate about being a death knight, if I could kill him I would in a heartbeat<br /> <br /> Mr. Muscles: Noisy, boisterous, and full of himself. surprisingly good and/or lucky with grappling<br /> <br /> god-blooded lady (I'm bad at names):irritable, surprisingly dependent on sword<br /> <br /> Marquee Oron: I seem to be putting a lot of trust in someone I know very little about. Half expecting it to blow up in my face<br /> <br /> there's probably one or two I'm forgetting but I'm mainly putting down the ones I've been nearby enough to have more than word of mouth/ likely to run into again<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T07:53:43-07:00","id":451513,"title":"","content":"So what happened last game -<br /> <br /> -We healed Eve and Bloodless talked to the necromancer. We questioned the guy that is totally not a Sidereal, but he was less than helpful.<br /> <br /> -We decided to take a cargo airship (so that Yolo and Makoto can come) to a town called The Aeryie. The plan was to find a ship there and go down the river to Sijan and then to Lookshy. While on the way there, Mayu healed Bloodless. He can now speak. <br /> <br /> -When we got to town, Alric headed off to who knows where and Mayu and Bloodless decided to go book shopping. This was TOTALLY Bloodless' idea! We were looking for books on Necromancy and Sorcery. We did find some sort of handwritten book. After we picked it up, another woman said that she needed it for work and would we please let her buy it. We said NOPE! and went to pay for the book. While Mayu was paying for the book, the woman used magic to snatch it out of her hands and threw up a magic wall of paper to block us from following her. <br /> <br /> -Bloodless busted though the paper wall (a lot harder than you think) and we went to chase after the woman, who was now joined by two other men. The two men managed to distract us (one guy breaths fire, the other guy is basically Drax from Guardians of the Galaxy. Bloodless wrestled with the Drax guy. Mayu managed to see the Woman with the book, who somehow managed to find a hand glider and was floating away. Mayu shot at her but missed. She didn't want to use fire arrows, because that might damage the book. We talk to the two men for a bit and then decide to find tracker to find the woman. Bloodless is kind of annoyed at Mayu for letting the woman get away and acting all chummy with the other guy while he was wrestling the Drax dude. <br /> <br /> -Enter our newest Night Caste. We meet him in the bar and paid him to track down this woman for us. This is where we left off, because we figured that we will need our thief to find the book. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T19:28:19-07:00","id":453627,"title":"","content":"I had an odd dream where the players started a band and I was writing actual music for it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T20:29:02-07:00","id":453732,"title":"","content":"So, who played which part in the band?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T21:55:56-07:00","id":453826,"title":"","content":"I honestly dont recall","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T22:59:49-07:00","id":453874,"title":"","content":"Bloodless is totally the drummer unless it's death metal, then he's the singer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T05:49:10-07:00","id":454135,"title":"","content":"I think Rynehart would be the bassist with a big axe shaped bass.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5280-gfrobbin84","name":"gfrobbin84","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-23T06:12:02-07:00","id":454147,"t