h conviction with the heart of flint flaw after all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5280-gfrobbin84","name":"gfrobbin84","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T19:35:12-07:00","id":457614,"title":"","content":"Just letting yall know that not this Friday but next Friday April 3rd I won't be able to get on till sometime between 9-10. I requested Sunday the 5th, Easter, off to spend with my kids but I have to work that Friday, which I normally have off, to get Sunday off. I'll get off between 8:30 and 9 just matter of what is going on in my house when get home as to how quickly I can get on.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5280-gfrobbin84","name":"gfrobbin84","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T19:35:15-07:00","id":458580,"title":"","content":"It happens, and thanks for the heads up. Makes it easier to plan around","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T12:36:05-07:00","id":459261,"title":"","content":"8 or 8:30 tonight?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"us