ore/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-05T13:12:15-07:00","id":469569,"title":"","content":"Mayu's Dodge charms say nope to that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-05-2015, 04:14 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-05T13:31:39-07:00","id":469576,"title":"","content":"Im not sure how cover dodging works but I'm sure it can be lawyered.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-05T16:36:07-07:00","id":469669,"title":"","content":"Something attacks Bloodless<br /> Bloodless hides behind Mayu.<br /> Mayu dodges attack, leaving Bloodless Exposed.<br /> Bloodless ???<br /> Profit!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T06:42:41-07:00","id":470100,"title":"","content":"Bloodless was almost exposed last game... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T07:54:48-07:00","id":470124,"title":"","content":"Bloodless has yet to find a reason not to dislike lunars yet. Just be happy that giant cat wasn't interested in Alric, I'm pretty sure his scrawny arms couldn't throw her off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T07:58:52-07:00","id":470144,"title":"","content":"Yeah. Mayu might be in the same boat. The Paper Fox took us for a Magical Mystery Tour though our fears. The first time Mayu met the Moose Guy, he was violently dining and dashing.<br /> <br /> Morale of the story - Lunars are asshats.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-06-2015, 11:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T10:39:09-07:00","id":474480,"title":"","content":"I forgot I said I was going to post a summary of last game:<br /> <br /> So, after the Paper Fox takes us on a tour of our greatest fears, Mayu leaves to go research Craft Genesis. Bloodless, however, decides to sacrifice his bioklaive to further his journey into Necromancy. This freaks his lunar mate out, so she goes off while he horrible tortures his bioklaive to death. <br /> <br /> Alric find a map to an old abandoned Lunar Manse. Mayu continues her research into Craft Genesis. She is hoping to be able to repair Bloodless' Bioklaive. Once Bloodless is finished with his grisly task, he returns to the library. Everyone gets called by the Librarian God to the entrance. Apparently, the Librarian God is pissed we brought a Deathknight into his Sanctum. He outs everyone as Celestrial Exalts and begins to kick us out. Mayu managed to make a deal with the Librarian God that she can return if she doubles the number of libraries in Creation. She agrees. We are thrown out of the library, with the knowledge of the library's location taken from us. <br /> <br /> Mayu is very pissed at Bloodless. This is the second library that Bloodless managed to get Mayu banned from. And she feels that she wasted her time in the library, learning Craft Genesis, since Bloodless horribly killed his Bioklaive. It is an awkward walk back to the city. Alric brings up this abandoned Lunar Manse that might have interesting things in it. So we decide to go there while we kill time waiting for the next airship/boat. <br /> <br /> On our way to the Manse, Mayu managed to piss off the local moose population by trying to hunt one down. The moose surround the camp. Alric recognizes his Lunar Mate and calls him out. Apparently the manse is not as abandoned as we were lead to believe. It belongs to Alric's Lunar Mate, but is run by some Lunar Elders. We meet with the Lunar Elders and agree to take a challenge to gain access to the manse. Afterwards we join the Wild Lunar party and discover that Lunar Liquor is very strong. Alric and Mayu get drunk under the table by Alric's Lunar Mate and Bloodless get attacked by (and managed to escape from) an Amorous Cougar. <br /> <br /> That is all I can remember from last game right now. We are going to do a backward time skip with our new Night Caste to get everyone's reaction to being outed as Anathema. And see what Rynehart found in the library.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T07:43:47-07:00","id":479035,"title":"","content":"So I always imagined Lookshy to be a large Harbor City with an obscenely large wall.<br /> <br /> This is now how I visualize Lookshy now:<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].styl