 messing with the Lover fairly soon I feel I should mention the Silver Prince and the Lover are rivals because they were together when they were alive. A big reason the Silver Prince is in the west is so 8000 miles makes messing with him a total pain in the ass. Also Ryneheart where art thou.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T20:43:06-07:00","id":483148,"title":"","content":"Is Ryneheart still with us or did something happen on his side?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T12:08:26-07:00","id":483788,"title":"","content":"Sorry I've had a busy week guys. I think I have everything in order for todays game. If there is something that you know of that I need to take care of contact me on skype","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-24T15:16:22-07:00","id":490990,"title":"","content":"Game tonight? 8 pm?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","e