eQdpRQcWZEZ3lwd1hDTDA/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-_...ew?usp=sharing</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2741-hemophage","name":"Hemophage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T20:38:03-07:00","id":540451,"title":"","content":"So, a couple things. While I'm not the ST there's a couple things I can still help you out with: You're supposed to have 125 exp not 150, you get 5 favored abilities not 3, and I'm a little surprised you favored dodge and left it at one while fully focusing on social things. I'm going to assume that's you waiting for perfect dodge, which is fine, it's just the longer you wait for a get out of jail free card the riskier it gets. Considering the social stats I don't think that'd be too often though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T09:57:21-07:00","id":541378,"title":"","content":"Hemophage, your character looks like a social monster (which is a good thing), but I should warn you that the ST likes to throw oddball rolls out. For example, there were times where we had to roll outside of our favored/castes abilities (Mayu has had to roll sail, melee, and integrity a few times). I'm not saying that you need to put something in every ability or you can't have five dots in an ability, but spreading your dots around a bit more would make your character's life easier. <br /> <br /> Also, don't underestimate the power of the 2nd Excellency Charm. It's probably my most used charm in the game.<br /> <br /> Anathema Character Generator is great for optimizing your character points: <a href=\"http://anathema.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\">http://anathema.github.io/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T12:52:53-07:00","id":541611,"title":"","content":"Before I forget, my grandparents are coming in around 9-10 (depending on your time zone) for my sister's graduation Saturday so if I need to leave for 5-15 minutes to bring their stuff in/say hi, that's why.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T20:32:56-07:00","id":542072,"title":"","content":"Updated character <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-_KNheQdpRQV1hHNUJDV3MzV00/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B-_...ew?usp=sharing</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2741-hemophage","user":"Hemophage","date":". 06-05-2015, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2741-hemophage","name":"Hemophage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T22:18:02-07:00","id":542249,"title":"","content":"Here's my character.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/4q2ip9c7vcyy5z9/KaralKatuXP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/4q2ip9c7vcyy5z9/KaralKatuXP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.mediafire.com/view/4q2ip9c7vcyy5z9/KaralKatuXP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.mediafire.com/view/4q2ip9c7vcyy5z9/KaralKatuXP.pdf </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-05T22:51:04-07:00","id":542287,"title":"","content":"Aww, you're no longer a sidereal. At least you took the background music charm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T00:05:05-07:00","id":542336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=542287#post542287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Aww, you're no longer a sidereal. At least you took the background music charm.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it got shot down. There was some fun stuff I would have been able to do.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T07:54:39-07:00","id":542621,"title":"","content":"sad, but I understand why. Sidereals are a pain to work in most things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-06T11:45:31-07:00","id":542785,"title":"","content":"ok guys I wont be home until about 10pm est next week. Considering cancelling since that only gives us two hours, or we could do something shorter, maybe a small down session after the fight?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T10:37:03-07:00","id":543994,"title":"","content":"If it's a short session like that, my vote would be to wait until the following week.<br /> <br /> I was mentioning that I wanted to make some custom charms, so Aeroz suggested I post it to see what we could come up with. I'd like something that helps with flurries. There is an existing magical flurry charm (Iron Whirlwind - 5m, 1wp) which gives you Dex+1 attacks, ignoring the weapon's natural Rate and all flurry penalties. I read this as something you use with your Rate 2 Grand Daiklave more than anything else. It's more about the extra attacks in a round, then the reduction in penalties thought I'm sure those help. <br /> <br /> I'd like something that lets me make attacks within the Rate of the weapons but without the penalties for Flurry. So, the Grand Daiklave would only get 2 attacks, but my paired Short Daiklaves would get 6 (Rate 3 + Rate 3). I was thinking it would reduce the flurry penalty for 1m per flurry die penalty negated. The reduction would apply to every attack in the flurry. Limit Dex+1 motes can be spent.<br /> <br /> Examples: Grand Daiklave, Rate 2: pay 2m and make a two attack flurry.<ul><li>First attack is at your base pool (-2 for the flurry, +2 for the charm).</li> <li>Second attack at base pool -1 (-3 for the flurry, +1 for the charm)</li> </ul><br /> Example: Daiklave, Rate 4: Pay 5m and make a 3 Flurry attack.<ul><li>First attack: full pool (-3 for flurry, +5 for charm).</li> <li>Second attack: full pool (-4 for flurry, +5 for charm).</li> <li>Third attack: full pool (-5 for flurry, +5 for charm)</li> </ul><br /> Example: Paired Short Daiklave, Rate 6: Pay 6m and make a 6 flurry attack.<ul><li>First attack: full pool (-6 Flurry, +6 charm)</li> <li>Second attack: pool-1 (-7 for Flurry, +6 for charm)</li> <li>Third attack: pool-2 (-8 for Flurry, +6 for charm)</li> <li>Fourth attack: pool-3</li> <li>Fifth attack: pool-4</li> <li>Sixth attack: pool-5 (-11 for Flurry, +6 for charm)</li> </ul><br /> Thoughts?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T11:58:40-07:00","id":544115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spaaace</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=543994#post543994\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If it's a short session like that, my vote would be to wait until the following week.</div> </div> </div> </div>It might be a good time to introduce the new characters, though; a short RP session to get them integrated with the party.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T12:25:18-07:00","id":544142,"title":"","content":"I am divided about the situation. I rather not wait until 10 pm to start game, but I also rather not wait to integrate new characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-07T12:59:23-07:00","id":544203,"title":"","content":"I'm fine with gaming for two hours personally, it'd mostly be recovery/setup for next week anyway.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T06:24:13-07:00","id":546961,"title":"","content":"So, the charm is perfect? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T06:33:17-07:00","id":546988,"title":"","content":"OP! NERF NIGHT CASTE!!!!!111","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T06:46:39-07:00","id":547004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spaaace</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=546961#post546961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, the charm is perfect? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>The charm is fine in a vacuum but realize going forward I wont let you have damage increasing charms (or atleast post soak or non-instant). Flurries are alot deadlier in 2.5 since an enemy cant afford to perfect every single strike. Flurries are meant for multiple enemies or to tink soak builds. Long as you understand that I'll approve it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T08:53:19-07:00","id":547116,"title":"","content":"You mean there may be limits on custom damage increasing charms, right? I would still be able to take the ones from the book (not that they're all that great).<br /> <br /> Besides, damage enhancement charms are paid for individually. If I wanted to pay 3m for each attack (because that would be declared at step 1), then that's 18m for a full 6 attack flurry; not cheap. If you miss, then the motes are lost. Even if it's post soak, you pay up front generally, right?<br /> <br /> Flurries are also meant for use against individuals with high DV because of the onslaught bonus.<br /> <br /> Alric does so little damage that all builds are soak builds to him. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> That said, I understand that we don't want custom charms to break the game.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T10:14:21-07:00","id":547249,"title":"","content":"I didn't even think we were allowed custom charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T11:20:37-07:00","id":547358,"title":"","content":"You're allowed to design custom charms AFTER character creation. It's a total pain in the ass to balance charms for someone who doesn't even stay in the game. For instance, I'm writing a custom Martial arts style that I will probably be using after Sijian. Btw making 9 charms is a total pain.<br /> <br /> Speaking of Sijian, I'm starting to think the Prince is ignoring his answering machine from all the death lords telling him &quot;wtf why is your death knight getting into fights with mine.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T11:48:00-07:00","id":547380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=547358#post547358\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of Sijian, I'm starting to think the Prince is ignoring his answering machine from all the death lords telling him &quot;wtf why is your death knight getting into fights with mine.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>This is the Silver Prince. If we are going with that he was an Eclipse, then he probably likes all the trouble you are causing. Gives him a chance to negotiate just like old times. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T12:15:00-07:00","id":547421,"title":"","content":"I wonder if god-king social combat takes as long as high essence actual combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T13:17:44-07:00","id":547458,"title":"","content":"Custom charms are allowed well after character creation. We've been playing for months now, I know they aren't trying to break the game and are making these charms to allow them to continue with their vision of the character. It is annoying to be hit with custom charms soon as the game starts for numerous reasons.<br /> <br /> Anyways, when it comes to bloodless making waves with the other deathlords, beyond the reasons of their insanity, remember long distance communication even with magic takes alot of time. If this kind of thing has consequences with the deathlords it will be weeks if not months before it gets back to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T13:18:54-07:00","id":547459,"title":"","content":"Also, I'll be talking with the new guys privately this week to work things out. If you aren't gonna be on skype much or there are certain times its better to reach you let meknow","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-09T20:58:34-07:00","id":547952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aeroz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=547459#post547459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, I'll be talking with the new guys privately this week to work things out. If you aren't gonna be on skype much or there are certain times its better to reach you let meknow</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm usually not on Skype typically, but I can hop on it more often if you want.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5492-xeno426","name":"Xeno426","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5492_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T06:42:35-07:00","id":551335,"title":"","content":"So, we're doing something around 10 tonight?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-12T13:11:45-07:00","id":552057,"title":"","content":"we will just do something casual today, talk, maybe some light gaming. Try to resolve some stuff","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T13:57:43-07:00","id":554843,"title":"","content":"random question, who would you say is your favorite NPC so far? Now I dont mean favorite as in &quot;I want to hang out with this guy&quot; but as a player you most enjoy showing up. So of course loving to hate someone and enjoying another chance to murder him counts too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T19:27:18-07:00","id":555124,"title":"","content":"I liked the tension that was caused by the Reaper. I've enjoyed the Sidereal shenanigans in general because they've been done mostly right considering how easily they can get abused. I also like the silver fox's cohorts because it was a weird and interesting event that could've gone a dozen ways. I'm really curious to see how the alchemical does things in the future (I'm wanting to make him a contact if not ally).<br /> <br /> As for a question for Aeroz: I've currently written 5 charms for my custom style. do you want me to PM or post the charms plus style equipment/prerequisites. I will admit some of them sound scary at first until you start considering how easily they can backfire, which is the point of style.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T20:40:57-07:00","id":555192,"title":"","content":"I like the reaper, the bartender (because he is a good example of how social skills can keep someone alive), and both Makotos.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T10:14:31-07:00","id":555831,"title":"","content":"I like both Makoto's. One because he's fun to spar with verbally, the other because I never expected Ride to be a big part of the character, but a fun mount makes all the difference.<br /> <br /> Also a fan of my Lunar mate (whose name escapes me at the moment, but is written down at home).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-15T16:43:42-07:00","id":556219,"title":"","content":"glad you guys like the reaper, sure you can see why he's one of my go to antagonists for games. Over all it seems I am succeeding where I am trying to build more compelling characters, the ones you mentioned are the most important NPCs. Rather ones I have plans for later.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-16T16:30:34-07:00","id":557497,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spaaace</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=555831#post555831\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also a fan of my Lunar mate (whose name escapes me at the moment, but is written down at home).</div> </div> </div> </div>Twice Spoken Call<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-17T09:40:09-07:00","id":558352,"title":"","content":"What was the name of that grapple Martial Art that the Paper Fox's friend was using?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T12:52:58-07:00","id":561063,"title":"","content":"We are playing today at 8pm EST as normal. I have some ideas for new players, will see how things go","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T21:56:07-07:00","id":561558,"title":"","content":"Turns out we were both thinking of Zhokai after all. 30% of its inhabitants are of races that were wiped out and I just remembered it being more than that.<br /> <br /> P.s. Do I need to attune to Void Apostle or is it paid for me by the nephwrack (can't remember his name).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":". 06-20-2015, 08:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-20T11:12:59-07:00","id":562094,"title":"","content":"He's paying for it, and its still &quot;his&quot; for the purposes of charms","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T06:51:59-07:00","id":565350,"title":"","content":"Sooo, I was reading how resonance works and Blight is limited by essence while conduit and branding are higher of whispers or essence and stigmata isn't limited by anything. This can be easily house ruled just thought you should know. I'm honestly not sure why there are limits to resonance in the first place considering the intent for limit break is to make all hell break loose.<br /> <br /> P.s. How do you guys edit the character sheet on the front, I've editing and saving over a personal file but I have no idea how to mess with the one on the front page.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3103,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","user":"Eura","date":". 06-23-2015, 10:04 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T08:18:14-07:00","id":565427,"title":"","content":"I just keep saving over the same file name in google drive. That will update the link.<br /> <br /> Also, I posted a Facebook status on Mayu's massive limit accruement. General Opinion of my exalted playing friends was &quot;Why are you hanging out with an Abyssal as a High Compassion character?&quot; and &quot;Why the fuck are you hanging out with an Abyssal in the first place?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T10:12:02-07:00","id":565511,"title":"","content":"I still believe I chose the lesser of two evils, the longer the Solars don't have to deal the Silver Prince's shenanigans the better, he's debatably the most dangerous of them. Also screw Google docs in general because I'm pretty sure I just deleted the link I was trying to save over. I honestly have no idea how you're doing that because trying to save with the same file name just made duplicates for me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T10:21:44-07:00","id":565514,"title":"","content":"Out of character, I'm sure you made the right choice. Mayu is not sure how she feels about the situation. She is in &quot;Fix it&quot; mode right now.<br /> <br /> Use Google Drive, not Google Docs. I have the Google Drive application on my computer (<a href=\"https://www.google.com/drive/download/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.google.com/drive/download/</a>), so it works just like a normal disk drive. I just save the file from Anathema as the same file name. The App uploads the new file.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 06-23-2015, 01:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T11:01:40-07:00","id":565572,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_bGakUT9OwNQ21QcDNMaU9sam8/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B_b...ew?usp=sharing</a> I'm just leaving that there because I figured it out finally but the old pdf was deleted beyond retrieval. Turns out I wasn't realizing the step where it had to be edited on your documents also don't learn computer stuff half awake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T11:34:14-07:00","id":565596,"title":"","content":"I think the Google Drive application is doing some magic for Mayu. I replace the contents of the PDF this way:<br /> 1. Go to the Google Drive site<br /> 2. click on the file<br /> 3. in the ellipsis &quot;More Actions&quot; menu options, pick &quot;Manage Versions&quot;<br /> 4. Click &quot;Upload new version&quot; and then attach the file<br /> <br /> I tried writing overtop the old file, but ended up with multiple copies before I figured out this trick.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-23T11:36:51-07:00","id":565598,"title":"","content":"Yeah. I don't use the Google Drive site. The google drive application lets me save over the pdf as the same name. I just double checked the link and it still works (and shows that Mayu has Essence 4).<br /> <br /> <br /> So.... I was going to take the Phantom Arrow Technique (Unlimited Arrow Charm), but I think I might take the Whirling Brush Technique first. Just in case I need to copy a particular Schematic rather quickly,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 06-23-2015, 02:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T10:05:54-07:00","id":568106,"title":"","content":"So, I need a little help with figuring out how to defend against social combat. I understand the Social DDV and PDV calculations (but wish Anathema would show both). As I understand it, Investigation can be used in Social combat and can be used to increase your static DV value via the Excellency. Correct? I ask because I have Investigation as a Favoured Ability and therefore could get the Excellency easily. The other Social-capable abilities, I'm at 0.<br /> <br /> Is that correct?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T10:34:53-07:00","id":568130,"title":"","content":"Investigation is really more an information gathering social ability to figure out if someone is lying and/or how to phrase your social attack to go against someone's intimacies, virtues, or motivation. Mental dodge dv is generally better because it helps deal with mental bullshit charms but parry lets you deal social attacks as well but parry is considered a retort so keep that in mind. I haven't used mental parry in years so I'm not sure if you can use socialize for it or not.<br /> <br /> on second thought investigation could be used for interrogation tactics and such.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T10:39:54-07:00","id":568135,"title":"","content":"So, basically I need to get Integrity?<br /> <br /> I was hoping I could use social PDV with Investigation instead of learning a new Ability...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T11:04:50-07:00","id":568167,"title":"","content":"Ok social combat is, clunky in exalted. Most magical effects target your DMDV, the integrity one. Your DV involving things like socialize or investigate is you 'parrying' a social attack with a rebuttal. Investigation lets you do things like discern motivations or intents. Though that doesn't mean you can necessarily put that to good use. For comparison its like how lore lets you know what a warstrider is, but craft is how you know how to apply that knowledge. So it can help you defend against social attacks but you still need skills like socialize to actually 'parry' it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T13:08:06-07:00","id":568260,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spaaace</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=568135#post568135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, basically I need to get Integrity?<br /> <br /> I was hoping I could use social PDV with Investigation instead of learning a new Ability...</div> </div> </div> </div>sorry refresh kept me from seeing this. Integrity is basically your passive defense against mental attacks, mostly its used against magically enforced effects. So you know integrity is also what you roll for things like wyld shaping effects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T13:46:38-07:00","id":568328,"title":"","content":"Integrity is also your &quot;I remember Crazy Fate Ninja&quot; roll.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T14:04:49-07:00","id":568369,"title":"","content":"This is why I have integrity favored, also they have quite a few useful charms although the abyssal intimacy enhancer is kind of hard to use properly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T14:06:34-07:00","id":568370,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=568369#post568369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This is why I have integrity favored, also they have quite a few useful charms although the abyssal intimacy enhancer is kind of hard to use properly.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Doesn't Integrity have the &quot;I can use Solar Charms now, you neverborn bitches!&quot; charm?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T14:31:42-07:00","id":568386,"title":"","content":"yes, its costs a point of resonance per use and oddly gives abyssals an access to holy charms. Honestly there's only a handful of charms where it's good instead of just an aesthetics change.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T15:26:16-07:00","id":568430,"title":"","content":"as a reminder, game tomorrow will be abit after 9, so not much pre-game discussion. Gonna jump us right in so we get enough play time","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T16:39:41-07:00","id":568498,"title":"","content":"Access to holy charms might be real handy when your cover gets blown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T16:56:21-07:00","id":568508,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spaaace</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=568498#post568498\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Access to holy charms might be real handy when your cover gets blown.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm totally not an <i>evil</i> anathema, just this other type of evil anathema. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T19:01:09-07:00","id":568646,"title":"","content":"I was thinking more of his cover against the other Abyssals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3104-spaaace","name":"Spaaace","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-28T15:37:52-07:00","id":571942,"title":"","content":"So I thought of something that might make Mayu hate me. Dynasty bonus effects still work on celestial exalted if they're related to them, so that means Thoughtful gift and such would work on her. Most dynasty charms are immediate family so I think that's just Makoto since exaltation was rare in Mayu's house. Also I forgot how much I love dragon-blooded social charms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3103-eura","name":"Eura","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"663"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-28T18:50:54-07:00","id":572071,"title":"","content":"Dynasty charms remind me of the Return of the Scarlet Empress, so they die in a fire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3945-aeroz","name":"Aeroz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"419"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-28T19:30:28-07:00","id":572104,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/265726-back-and-looking-to-play-skype-game-recruiting?p=571942#post571942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I thought of something that might make Mayu hate me. Dynasty bonus effects still work on celestial exalted if they're related to them, so that means Thoughtful gift and such would work on her. Most dynasty charms are immediate family so I think that's just Makoto since exaltation was rare in Mayu's house. Also I forgot how much I love dragon-blooded social charms.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Mayu doesn't really have a &quot;house&quot;, just a large Looksian Helot extended family who engages in heretical worship of the Immaculate Dragons*. Makoto is probably the only one that has exalted as far back as anyone could remember.<br /> <br /> * By the way, Aeroz, I decided that the majority of Mayu's Helot family engages in Heretical worship of the Immaculate Dragons. Neither Mayu or Makoto do, and Makoto in particular is rather embarrassed by the whole situation. Bas